{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>最後朝聖機會！座落於旺角朗豪坊、為期一年的海外首間「Chiikawa Ramen Buta」主題拉麵店將營業至 2026 年 9 月 6 日（星期日）正式落幕！這間以漫畫靈魂場景「郎」拉麵為概念的實體店，還原了經典打卡牆，Chiikawa們陪大家一起吃拉麵！除了3大基本款式，香港店之後都推出師傅、古本屋、飛鼠等主題拉麵。一開幕的時候，店內的拉麵精品也被搶購的！大家要把握最後機會！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17846208380619128_5755307426a5f272682a61.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17846208399325619_13755980316a5f27284793c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178462084165979264_13904008766a5f272b86b51.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178462084495064436_1514351826a5f272e63f3c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17846208491592551_16910479936a5f2731aa35b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T08:18:47.335857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}